docs {
  # Get Group Expenses (`GetGroupExpenses`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetGroupExpenses` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/groups/:groupId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Retrieves all expenses assigned to the designated group ordered by `expense_date desc`:
  - Preloads `Splits`, `Splits.User`, and the payer `User`.
  - If `group.simplifyDebts == true`, runs the debt simplification algorithm (`functions.SimplifyDebts`) to net out multi-hop shared balances into a minimal transaction graph before returning.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `groupId` (string, path parameter): Group ID.
}
